  "name": "Village of Barovia",
  "region": "village_of_barovia",
  "summary": "A shuttered village in a mist-choked valley: muddy streets, boarded houses, a tavern with almost no wine, a mansion under siege, and a church on the hill where something screams at night.",
  "text": "The Old Svalich Road runs through the village from the gates and the mists in the east to the far hills in the west, past doors nailed shut. A big house stands behind an iron fence to the north-west, a church on its rise to the north-east, and a tall, handsome house behind a rusted fence at the south-east edge.",
