      "codex": "village_curfew_notice",
      "text": "By order of the burgomaster, Kolyan Indirovich: no one is to be abroad after dusk. Doors barred, shutters closed, lamps out by the second bell. Do not answer a knock you were not expecting, whoever it claims to be. Do not go to the castle. Do not go to the mists. Do not go into the house at the end of the lane. Below, in another hand, smaller: he is not coming back to read this."
